2025-11-08 04:28:29,900 | INFO | ai-engine.scorer | Actual: Step-by-Step Guide: Updating Your Mobile Number in Emirates ID  Updating your mobile number linked to your Emirates ID is a straightforward process that can be completed online through the official portal of the Federal Authority for Identity, Citizenship, Customs & Port Security (ICP). Here’s how you can do it:  1. Visit the ICP Portal   Go to the official ICP website: https://icp.gov.ae 1.  2. Access the Interactive Services   Navigate to the “Interactive Services” section.  Look for the service related to updating non-essential data, such as your phone number and address3.  3. Enter Your Details   Fill in your Emirates ID number and other required personal information as prompted on the portal2.  4. Input the New Mobile Number   Enter your new mobile number in the designated field2.  5. Verify the New Number   You will receive a One-Time Password (OTP) on your new mobile number.  Enter the OTP on the portal to verify and confirm the update2.  6. Submit and Confirm   Review all details for accuracy.  Submit your request. You should receive a confirmation message once the update is successful2.  Additional Tips   Ensure your new mobile number is active and accessible to receive the OTP.  If you encounter any issues, you can use the ICP’s live chat support or contact their customer service for assistance3.  The process may require a small service fee, depending on the latest ICP regulations.  References  1: ICP Official Portal – Home 
2: BestaxCA – Change Mobile Number Emirates ID: Easy Steps 
3: Emirabiz – Changing Your Registered Mobile Number in Emirates ID     Sources  Ask  Explain
