2025-11-08 11:55:03,174 | INFO | ai-engine.scorer | Actual: Step-by-Step Guide: How to Get a UAE Pass  The UAE Pass is the official national digital identity for citizens, residents, and visitors in the United Arab Emirates. It enables secure access to thousands of government, semi-government, and private sector services online, as well as digital document signing12.  Below is a clear, step-by-step guide to obtaining your UAE Pass:  1. Download the UAE Pass App   The UAE Pass app is available for both iOS and Android devices.  Download it from the Apple App Store or Google Play Store.  Alternatively, you can scan the QR code provided on the official UAE Pass website to download the app directly13.  2. Start the Registration Process   Open the UAE Pass app on your device.  On the initial screen, tap the Sign Up button to begin creating your new account1.  3. Enter Your Personal Details   Fill in the required information, such as your Emirates ID number (for residents/citizens), mobile number, and email address.  Follow the on-screen instructions to proceed.  4. Verify Your Identity   The app uses biometric face recognition (facial ID) to verify your identity.  Follow the prompts to scan your face using your device’s camera.  This step replaces the previous requirement to visit a government service center for verification, making the process faster and more convenient23.  5. Set Up Your Digital Identity   Once your identity is verified, set a secure PIN code for your UAE Pass account.  You may also be prompted to enable additional security features, such as fingerprint or face unlock, depending on your device.  6. Complete Registration   After setting up your PIN and security options, your UAE Pass account will be activated.  You can now use your UAE Pass to access over 6,000 services from government, semi-government, and private sector entities across the UAE23.  7. Optional: Access Additional Features   Use the app to digitally sign documents, store and share official documents securely, and update your profile or address records.  The digital vault feature allows you to request and manage digital versions of your official documents3.  Support   For assistance, you can contact the UAE Pass help desk at 600 561 111, available 24/723.  Summary Table  Step  Action  Details/Notes   1 Download UAE Pass app iOS & Android, or scan QR code  2 Start registration Tap "Sign Up"  3 Enter personal details Emirates ID, mobile, email  4 Verify identity Facial recognition via app  5 Set up digital identity Create PIN, enable security features  6 Complete registration Account activated, ready to use  7 Access additional features (optional) Digital vault, document signing, profile update    References  1: UAE Pass Official Signup Guide 
2: Federal Authority for Identity, Citizenship, Customs & Port Security – UAE Pass Overview 
3: UAE Government Portal – About the UAE Pass App   If you need further clarification or encounter any issues during the process, please let me know!    Sources  Ask  Explain
