2025-11-08 11:55:42,972 | INFO | ai-engine.scorer | Actual: Step-by-Step Guide: Updating Your Mobile Number in Emirates ID  You can update the mobile number linked to your Emirates ID through several convenient methods. Below is a clear, step-by-step guide for the online process, which is the most commonly used and recommended approach.  1. Visit the ICP Portal   Go to the official website of the Federal Authority for Identity, Citizenship, Customs & Port Security (ICP): https://icp.gov.ae 1.  2. Access the Update Service   Look for the service related to updating non-essential data (such as phone number and address).  Alternatively, you may find this under “Update Personal Info” or similar sections2.  3. Enter Your Details   Log in using your Emirates ID information.  Fill in the required personal details as prompted by the system2.  4. Input Your New Mobile Number   Enter the new mobile number you wish to link to your Emirates ID.  Double-check the number for accuracy before proceeding2.  5. Verify with OTP (One-Time Password)   You will receive an OTP on the new mobile number.  Enter the OTP on the portal to verify and confirm the change2.  6. Pay the Service Fee (if applicable)   Online changes typically incur a fee (e.g., AED 53)4.  Complete the payment process as instructed.  7. Confirmation   Once the process is complete, you should receive a confirmation notification.  Your Emirates ID record will be updated with the new mobile number.  Alternative Methods   ICA UAE Smart App:  You can also use the official ICA app to update your mobile number.  Smart Police Stations:  Some locations offer free updates at smart police stations4.  Important Notes   Ensure your new mobile number is active and accessible to receive the OTP.  Keep your Emirates ID and other required documents handy during the process.  If you encounter any issues, you can use the ICP website’s live chat or virtual assistant for support1.  References  1: ICP Official Services – Update Non-Essential Data 
2: BestaxCA – Change Mobile Number Emirates ID: Easy Steps 
3: EBS – How to Change the Mobile Number Linked to Your Emirates ID 
4: Emirabiz – Change Mobile Number Emirates ID (Online, App, Police Station)     Sources  Ask  Explain
